   "sourceHash": "560b51f3e1f967d4fe7022159153eb422dd2875f33a7be30b6bea44951f27027",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]सप्ताह में एक बार योग पर निःशुल्क व्याख्यान।[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
